{"unit_id":"tag:04P0:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节对应于《下降（Descent）》第 <REF_0001> 节。目前，我们不知道关于概形（schemes）的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings）的所有内容是否也对代数空间（algebraic spaces）成立。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名，暂译。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04P1:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），由 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）组成。假设对每个 <MATH_0004>，我们都有开子空间 <MATH_0005>，使得对所有 <MATH_0006>，都有 <MATH_0007>，这里将它们视为 <MATH_0008> 的开子空间。则存在唯一的开子空间 <MATH_0009>，使得 <MATH_0010> 对每个 <MATH_0011> 成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04P1:proof","translation":"由《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0001>，可假设每个 <MATH_0001> 都是概形（scheme）。选取概形（scheme）<MATH_0002> 和满射的（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。则 <MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0005> 的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），且 <MATH_0006> 对每个 <MATH_0007> 都是概形（scheme）。因此，由《下降（Descent）》引理 <REF_0002>，开集族 <MATH_0008> 来自唯一的开子概形 <MATH_0009>。由于 <MATH_0010> 是开的，可以定义 <MATH_0011> 为 <MATH_0012> 的像（image）所给出的 Zariski 开集，见《代数空间的性质》第 <REF_0003> 节。我们略去这一构造确实有效的验证，即 <MATH_0013> 是 <MATH_0014> 的逆（inverse）像（image），对每个 <MATH_0015> 都如此。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章名，暂译。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名，暂译。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"逆像语境，暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04P2:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），由 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）组成，见《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》定义 <REF_0001>。则给定代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0004>，其基底为 <MATH_0005>，序列 <MATH_0006> 是等化子（equalizer）图（diagram）。换言之，<MATH_0007> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）上的每个可表（representable）函子（functor）都满足 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings）的层条件（sheaf condition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章名，暂译。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件","context":"暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04P2:proof","translation":"我们知道，若 <MATH_0001> 是概形（schemes）的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），则结论成立，见《代数空间的性质》命题 <REF_0001>。这是关键事实；我们建议读者跳过证明中余下的形式推导。选取概形（scheme）<MATH_0002> 和满射的（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。设 <MATH_0004> 是概形（scheme），并设 <MATH_0005> 是满射的（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）。则 <MATH_0006> 是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。这由《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003> 得出。由上述结果，我们得到 <MATH_0007> 的结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n其含义如下：假设 <MATH_0008> 是态射族（family of morphisms），满足 <MATH_0009>，这里将它们视为态射（morphisms）<MATH_0010>。令 <MATH_0011> 为 <MATH_0012> 与 <MATH_0013> 的复合（composition）。由上述论述，存在唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>，使得 <MATH_0015> 是 <MATH_0016> 与 <MATH_0017> 的复合（composition）。唯一性保证 <MATH_0018>，这里将它们视为态射（morphisms）<MATH_0019>。于是，因为 <MATH_0020> 作为层（sheaf）成立，我们得到 <MATH_0021> 来自唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0022>。追踪交换图（diagrams），我们发现 <MATH_0023> 就是所求的态射（morphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"morphi