{"unit_id":"tag:06NR:proof","translation":"选取概形（scheme）<MATH_0001> 和满射的（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>。选取概形（scheme）<MATH_0003> 和满射的（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>。选取概形（scheme）<MATH_0005> 和满射的（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>。由假设，可以找到 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0007>，以及态射（morphism）<MATH_0009> 的提升 <MATH_0008>。由于 <MATH_0010> 满射（surjective）且平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale），我们看到，在 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0011> 的各成员上存在到 <MATH_0012> 的提升。因此 <MATH_0013> 诱导了 <MATH_0014> 上的层（sheaves）的满射（surjection）。根据我们关于代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）具有性质 <MATH_0015> 的定义（见《代数空间的态射（Morphisms）》定义 <REF_0001>、定义 <REF_0002> 和定义 <REF_0003>），我们看到 <MATH_0016> 具有 <MATH_0017>，而需要证明 <MATH_0018> 具有 <MATH_0019>。于是问题归结到概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）的情形，《下降（Descent）》引理 <REF_0004> 已处理这一情形。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"s