{"unit_id":"tag:0AHC:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是交换图（commutative diagram），由 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）组成。假设 <MATH_0004> 满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation），并假设 <MATH_0005> 局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）（相应地，<SPACE_0001>局部有限型（locally of finite type））。则 <MATH_0006> 局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）（相应地，<SPACE_0002>局部有限型（locally of finite type））。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型","context":"暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0AHC:proof","translation":"由于 <MATH_0001> 是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），它诱导了 fppf 层（sheaves）的满射（surjection）（《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0001>），故此引理是引理 <REF_0002> 的特例。另一方面，更简单的论证是从概形（schemes）的对应结果推导它。具体而言，问题在 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003> 上是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）局部的（《代数空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0003> 和 <REF_0004>）。因此可以假设 <MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005> 是仿射概形（affine schemes）。由于 <MATH_0006> 是开的（《代数空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0005>），可以选取仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0007> 和平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，使得复合（composition）<MATH_0009> 满射（surjective）。此时，结果由《下降（Descent）》引理 <REF_0006> 得出。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章名，暂译。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名，暂译。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形",