{"unit_id":"tag:0AHD:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是交换图（commutative diagram），由 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）组成。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> 满射（surjective）且句法（syntomic）（相应地，<SPACE_0001>光滑（smooth）；相应地，<SPACE_0002>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005> 句法（syntomic）（相应地，<SPACE_0003>光滑（smooth）；相应地，<SPACE_0004>平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale））。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则 <MATH_0006> 句法（syntomic）（相应地，<SPACE_0005>光滑（smooth）；相应地，<SPACE_0006>平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale））。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"覆盖性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0AHD:proof","translation":"我们从概形（schemes）的对应结果推导这一结论。具体而言，问题在 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 上是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）局部的（《代数空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>）。因此可以假设 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004> 是仿射概形（affine schemes）。由于 <MATH_0005> 是开的（《代数空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0004>），可以选取仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0006> 和平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，使得复合（composition）<MATH_0008> 满射（surjective）。此时结果由《下降（Descent）》引理 <REF_0005> 得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名，暂译。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名，暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
